# Repeated sells hit our bid until the position limit (500 shares) blocks it.
#
# Each round, a seller clears the best bid and our 100 shares at 99.99, then
# the bid refills. We re-enter the bid after each fill until we are long 500:
# after that a new buy of 100 would exceed the limit, so the bid side stops
# while the ask keeps quoting. Finally a buyer lifts our ask, the position
# drops to 400, and the bid comes back.
#
# Participants: 2 and 3 provide the book, 4 takes liquidity.

latency market_data 5_000
latency order_entry 10_000
timer 1_000_000
end 30_000_000

0            2 enter 1 B 500 100.00
0            2 enter 2 B 300 99.98
0            3 enter 1 S 500 100.01
0            3 enter 2 S 400 100.02
0            3 enter 3 S 300 100.03

# Five rounds: sell 600 at 99.99 (clears 100.00 and our 100), then the bid
# refills at 100.00.
2_000_000    4 enter 1 S 600 99.99 ioc
3_000_000    2 enter 3 B 500 100.00
5_000_000    4 enter 2 S 600 99.99 ioc
6_000_000    2 enter 4 B 500 100.00
8_000_000    4 enter 3 S 600 99.99 ioc
9_000_000    2 enter 5 B 500 100.00
11_000_000   4 enter 4 S 600 99.99 ioc
12_000_000   2 enter 6 B 500 100.00
14_000_000   4 enter 5 S 600 99.99 ioc
15_000_000   2 enter 7 B 500 100.00

# Long 500: the bid side is blocked. Market activity keeps arriving.
17_000_000   2 enter 8 B 200 99.99
18_000_000   2 cancel 8

# A buyer lifts the offer through our ask at 100.02: long 400, bid resumes.
20_000_000   4 enter 6 B 1000 100.02 ioc
22_000_000   3 enter 4 S 500 100.01
22_000_000   3 enter 5 S 400 100.02
